      "content": "hey so i just got diagnosed with hyperthyroidism like last week and my doctor started me on some meds but i've been taking adderall for my adhd for a few years now. i've been feeling kinda jittery and my heart feels like it's racing more than usual lately since the thyroid thing started. is it okay to keep taking my adderall or is that gonna mess with my heart too much?",
