      "content": "It is very common for hyperthyroidism and ADHD medications like Adderall to cause overlapping symptoms such as jitteriness and a rapid heartbeat, as thyroid hormones naturally increase your heart rate and Adderall is a stimulant. Because these conditions can significantly strain your cardiovascular system, you should not stop taking your Adderall abruptly, but you must inform your doctor immediately about your new rash or symptoms. Your healthcare provider may need to adjust the dosage of either medication or switch treatments to ensure your heart rate stays safe for both conditions.",
